<title>USA: Russ Berrie authorizes further share buyback.</title>
<headline>Russ Berrie authorizes further share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>OAKLAND, N.J. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russ Berrie and Co Inc said Wednesday that its board of directors has authorized it to buy back an additional one million shares its common stock.</p>
<p>Since beginning its stock repurchase program in March 1990, the company has authorized the repurchase of three million shares and has actually bought back 2,450,000 shares.</p>
<p>The company has 22,1970,000 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
